MEGA65 (model $03), 384K chip RAM, 8MB attic RAM

>10 PRINT "hello from B65FILE1"
>20 FOR I%=1 TO 3:PRINT I%;:NEXT:PRINT
>SAVE "B65FILE1"
>NEW
>LOAD "B65FILE1"
>LIST
   10 PRINT "hello from B65FILE1"
   20 FOR I%=1 TO 3:PRINT I%;:NEXT:PRINT
>RUN
hello from B65FILE1
         1         2         3
>NEW
>10 F%=OPENIN "B65FILE1"
>20 IF F%=0 THEN PRINT "OPENIN failed":END
>30 N%=0:REPEAT B%=BGET#F%:N%+=1:UNTIL EOF#F%
>40 PRINT "read ";N%;" bytes, PTR=";PTR#F%
>50 CLOSE#F%
>60 PRINT "missing file gives ";OPENIN "B65NONE"
>70 CHAIN "B65FILE1"
>RUN
read 60 bytes, PTR=60
missing file gives 0
hello from B65FILE1
         1         2         3
>LOAD "B65NONE"

File not found
>*CAT
